window.products.push({"id":813038,"name":"Thermos 16 Oz Stainless Steel Perfect Hot Coffee, Green Tea or Cup of Chai. Insulated Water Bottle Keeps You Hydrated. Beverage Cooler to Keep Your So","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q86vjkNSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"New 2013 Stainless Steel Thermos An ideal choice for people on the go, the Stainless Steel Insulated Beverage Bottle is built to last and loaded with features to make for a more enjoyable drinking experience. Double wall insulation technology virtually eliminates temperature change within the beverage container by creating space between two stainless steel walls. The result is an insulation layer that performs better than any other. A superior insulated container you can depend on to keep your beverages hotter, colder, fresher, longer.This beverage is a great choice for wherever life's adventures may take you. Features and Benefits - Constructed with double wall stainless steel, this 16 ounce beverage bottle is virtually unbreakable, yet its sleek design is both eye-catching and functional.- The specially designed pop stopper lets you pour without having to remove the stopper completely.- The Stainless Steel Insulated Beverage Bottle is made of BPA-free materials.- This beverage bottle comes equipped with its own built-in, insulated stainless steel serving cup, so there is no need to pack an additional cup. Leak-Proof and Worry-Free Top of the line construction and rubber gaskets keep this bottle leak-proof and because of the double wall insulation, the stainless steel body stays cool to the touch with hot beverages and condensation-free with cold beverages. Recommended Tip In order to maximize the incredible insulation technology, it is recommended to pre-chill or pre-heat the beverage bottle just prior to use. This can be accomplished by filling the bottle with cold or hot water, attaching the lid and letting it rest for a few minutes. Before you are ready to use, simply empty the water and fill with your favorite beverage. Attaching the lid will further increase the thermal efficiency.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q86vjkNSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Premium Choice Products","source_asin":"B00FKPGEBO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-813038","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FKPGEBO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FKPGEBO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
