window.products.push({"id":813072,"name":"Kingfun Mid Century Headboard for Queen Size Bed, Velvet Upholstered Tufted Bed Headboard with Nailhead Decor, Adjustable Curved Solid Wood Head Board","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81s5yEy8mVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STURDY CONSTRUCTION:Don't be bothered by stability anymore! The legs of the bed board is made of durable solid rubberwood which has great distortion resistance and high toughness. The high-quality screws with a solid wood frame bring strong solidity to this queen size head board that promises a long service life. It will in your life for a long time. PREMIUM MATERIAL:The tufted headboard features stain-resistant performance velvet which prevents fading while providing an excellent touch. The interior of the padded headboard queen is filled with 40D high-density foam, and its excellent resilience can give you long-lasting comfort when leaning against the headboard. The headboard upholstered queen adds luxury to your bedroom while bringing comfort to you and your family. MID CENTURY DESIGN:More luxury design! The tufted design with rivets keeps the queen headboard understated without losing its character and smooth lines bring elegance to bedrooms, guest rooms. In color matching, we use neutral hues like grey or green which adds a tranquil, relaxing feel to any room. The bed headboard will be the ideal choice for your bedroom, guest room. ADJUSTABLE HEADBOARD:To meet the need of various mattress and box spring height combinations, this queen size bed headboard adopts a unique free-adjustment technology. It can be adjusted to any height in 47’’-55’’ instead of a fixed adjustment gear. So you don't have to worry about affecting aesthetics. Folding headboard design saves your home space! EASY TO ASSEMBLE:Our backboard for bed adopts a detachable design to enhance shipping efficiency that easier to move into your home. And then follow the steps in the instructions to install the screws, an exquisite adjustable headboard will appear in your eyes in 10 minutes. If you have any problems with the installation of the queen headboards, please contact us at any time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81s5yEy8mVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kingfun","source_asin":"B09VN12856","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-813072","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VN12856","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VN12856","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":813073,"name":"Lazy Susan Organizer, Clear Acrylic Large Lazy Susan Turntable Organizer with Dividers, Spinning Spice Lazy Susan Organizer Pantry for Cabinet/Bathroo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M+EpYNiPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Great Organizing Capabilities】Our clear acrylic lazy susan spice organizer boasts great organizing capabilities with ample space to hold numerous bottles. With removable dividers, the lazy susan organizer for cabinet helps keep the bottles in place during motion and prevents them from falling over. The elegant design adds class and sophistication to any space, surpassing a standard clear design. 【Perfect for Home Organization】 Our lazy susan condiments organizer bins are perfect for home organization. They're an ideal fit for kitchen cabinets, where they can be used to store condiments and other items. With multiple compartments, our clear lazy susan organizer make it easy to keep things organized while still allowing for easy access. Additionally, they can be used in the bathroom to hold perfumes, as a fridge organizer for bottles and drinks, or even to store office supplies or vitamin bottles. 【High Rotatability】Our countertop lazy susan boasts high rotatability thanks to its smooth and quiet rotating mechanism. With a high rotatability stainless steel ball bearing, our turntable acrylic kitchen lazy susan for cabinet can effortlessly rotate even under heavy loads without getting stuck. Plus, the ball bearing allows for frictionless rotation for hundreds of millions of cycles. 【Removable Dividers】Designed with 6 divided sections to organize small, miscellaneous items from a pile in cabinet to this handy 12 inch lazy susan. The dividers made all the difference for people who has lots of smaller bottles. This large lazy susan for pantry helps them to stay more in place rather than shift around when the spinner is actually in motion. The look of it gives it even more class than a standard basic clear design.The cylindrical fastener allows the dividers to be secured in the lazy susan. You can also use the entire lazy susan space by taking away the dividers. 【High Quality and Durable】The kitchen lazy susan cabinet organizer is both high-quality and durable. It comes fully assembled and is ready to use right out of the box. The transparent, clear spinning organizer allows you to easily see all of your items, and the sturdy acrylic plastic construction can hold even heavy glass bottles without affecting rotation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M+EpYNiPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Juorvoro","source_asin":"B0BTXD1JYP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-813073","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTXD1JYP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTXD1JYP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
