window.products.push({"id":813321,"name":"Kinks & Quirks Hippie Chick Lori Mitchell Figurine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41lNJ8c5J0L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Specification Material: Hand painted resin Originality: Original Weight: 1.00 LBS ABOUT US: Almost everything we sell is handmade or designed in America. We are so proud to represent such amazing and talented artists…there have been over 1,400 through the years! Unique handcrafted works from over 400 artisans from throughout the United States are on display. Fall in love with these Figures: Fall in love with this darling piece! Designed by Lori, In Lori’s signature style, Figure is adorned in traditional folk art patterns and motifs while a blissfully happy expression graces its adorable face. The delightful duo poses atop an intricately hand painted figure that perfectly complements the scene of love. This lovely summer piece makes a sweet gift for your loved one on any day of the year. One of the featured artists for The Kinks & Quirks is Lori Mitchell . Lori Mitchell was born and raised in Marietta, Georgia. She is a graduate of the Rhode Island School of Design. Lori finds inspiration in old illustrations, children’s tales and anything whimsical. In 1998, she discovered folk art, and fell in love with the charm and nostalgia that this field embraces. Lori creates pieces that take people back to the magical years of childhood. In designing, Lori starts off with an idea, but as she sculpts, the characters begin to define their own personality. Lori is known for her exaggerated proportions and expressions…and every piece must have crazy socks! Lori creates pieces that take people back to the magical years of childhood.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41lNJ8c5J0L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kinks & Quirks","source_asin":"B08BKX4RMN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-813321","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BKX4RMN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BKX4RMN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
