window.products.push({"id":813447,"name":"Andaz Press Round Ceramic Porcelain Christmas Tree Ornament Keepsake Collectible Gift for Cousins, Cousins are Little Girls That Grow Up to Be Best Fr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512cwaRzdML._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"INCLUDES: 1 round ceramic porcelain ornament designed by Andaz Press, 1 gold cord ribbon, 1 gift box. SIZE: 2.8-inch wide. PROPERTIES: Made with fine white ceramic porcelain with a beautiful glossy glaze finish. Each original handmade ornament is permanently fused, so the art becomes part of the ornament. Handmade with love in the USA. PERFECT for decorating your Christmas tree, or for giving to your friends, family and loved ones. Our high quality porcelain ornaments make perfect keepsake heirloom collectibles. READY TO GIFT. Each ornament comes safely packed in a beautiful gift box, with a beautiful ribbon. You can ship it directly to your friends and family. ORIGINAL DESIGN by Andaz Press. All rights reserved. Search Andaz Press on Amazon for many more gifts and party decor. We have something for everyone special in your life!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512cwaRzdML._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Andaz Press","source_asin":"B081XYL94Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-813447","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081XYL94Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081XYL94Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":813448,"name":"F.A. Dumont Prinknash Abbey Incense, Cathedral","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T7FpHXZ-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Benedictine Monks of Prinknash Abbey have been blending incense since 1906 when the community was on Caldey Island in the United Kingdom, and are now the oldest major incense blenders in Europe. Inspired by Exodus 30:34-35 the Monks developed unique processes for blending the purest Arabian frankincense with precious aromatic oils and spices and created superior recipes for a range of incenses. The blends now produced at the Abbey are made to long-established recipes. Consistent excellence ensures that each blend has its regular devoted customers in every continent. Prinknash Abbey is situated in Gloucestershire, England, and is the home to a community of Roman Catholic Benedictine Monks. Their life is regulated by the Rule of St Benedict that was written 1500 years ago in Italy. It was, after the Bible, the most influential Christian document in Europe during the Middle Ages, and still has relevance today. The community began life in the Church of England when their founder, Abbot Aelred Carlyle, set up a small community in the Isle of Dogs, London. After many wanderings, they eventually settled on Caldey Island off Tenby, South Wales, and became Roman Catholic in 1913. However, financial pressures forced the community to leave Caldey and in December 1928, they came to Prinknash Park, where they have been ever since. Based on recipes developed by the monks, the Cathedral incense is a blend of pure frankincense and natural oils which has its own distinctive fragrance and aroma. Decades of care in the blending of this incense has ensured excellence and constant demand. Each box contains 1lb of incense.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T7FpHXZ-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"F A Dumont","source_asin":"B098B6B9TH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-813448","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098B6B9TH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098B6B9TH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
