window.products.push({"id":813492,"name":"Cordless Blackout Bamboo Roman Shades, Light Filtering UV Protection Wooden Roller Blinds with 6\" H Valance, Custom Room Darkening Roller Bamboo Blind","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wEcLeH9rL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Bamboo DESCRIPTION: Cordless bamboo blinds made of 100% natural materials. Pull the bottom bar gently to roll up and down the shades. All the bamboo blinds come with 6inch high matching valance. Blackout and light filtering pattern for you to choose, shades with liner will block 90% light, shades without liner cannot protect privacy. Bamboo blinds are intended for indoor use. If you want to mount it outdoor please install the blind under the roof to prevent rainwater. MADE-TO-ORDER: We provide custom service for dressing your room perfectly, exact cut to 1/16th Inch. Pick up the color you like then go to \"Customize Now\", leave the custom information you need. We will double confirm in 24 hours, reply the confirm email in 48 hours after you placed the order. If we don’t get your reply, then we make the shade size as you ordered and take no change. INSIDE MOUNT: Min frame depth should be 2\" for inside mount. Choose the exact WINDOW INSIDE WIDTH and HEIGHT to place order. We will take a deduction, your shade will arrive with a 0.4\" narrower width to ensure a proper inside fit. For example, if window inside are 35.75\" wide by 42\" high,choose inside mount,then select 35\" W and 12/16 as the order width, select 42\"H as the order height, the roller shade you get will be 35.35\" Wide by 42\" high. OUTSIDE MOUNT: Shade width need to be 3 to 6\" wider than window width, shade height need to be 5 to 10\" longer than window height for better coverage. For example, if window outside is 25.5\" wide by 42\" high, shade width should more than 28.5\"(25.5\"+3\"), shade height should longer than 50\"(42\"+8\"). Select the closest width 29\" W and height 50\"H to place order. This is your order size, you will get the exact size you order.The shade you get will be 29\" Wide by 50\" high. SHIPPING: WE DO NOT DELIVER TO PO BOX ADDRESSES AND APO ADDRESS. Courier companies do not deliver to PO boxes and APO address because the shades are too long for Post. When you shop with us,we warrant that your project will be a success. No matter if you made a mistake or there are other issues, you will be covered.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wEcLeH9rL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZY Blinds","source_asin":"B09CV67LJX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-813492","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CV67LJX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CV67LJX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
