window.products.push({"id":813596,"name":"Hammered Copper Chef Pan, Handmade Authentic Red Copper Skillet, Turkish Egg Omelette Frying Pans, Copper Cookware Sahan (10.6 in - 27 cm)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SxPwqAzBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Hakan copper round chef pan is a cookware perfect for making delicious omelets and any other kinds of food in no time. With its sturdy structure, you can have it among your other utensils for many years in your kitchen. Copper is an excellent heat conductor, so if you keep the fire at the lowest temperature, you can provide perfect cooking without disturbing the tinning and consuming less energy. The frying pan is also easy to put to use. It's designed for use with all types of stovetops except induction. Thanks to its brass handles, you can also use it in the oven. This pan is a perfect present for chefs, for Christmas, Thanksgiving, Housewarming, Birthdays, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Weddings, and any special day. Your loved ones who love to cook will love this thoughtful gift. CARE INSTRUCTIONS BEFORE FIRST USE, clean with hot water and dish soap. In order to clean it, please use liquid dishwasher detergents. DO NOT RUB your pan’s surface with wire or other any kind of hard cleaning materials. Rubbing may lead to scratching the surface. DO NOT LEAVE your pan on fire without liquid or food in any circumstances. Washing it in the dishwasher may fade its color and ruin its material, so it is not recommended. You can boil water with lemon juice, vinegar, or citric acid to clean spots and lime scales that may occur inside the pan. It is not compatible with induction stoves.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SxPwqAzBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hakan","source_asin":"B0C7LQSMBC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-813596","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7LQSMBC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7LQSMBC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
