window.products.push({"id":813740,"name":"Kitchen Sink Organizer Caddy, Sponge Holder for Kitchen Sink With Drain Pan Tray, Stainless Steel Rust-proof Brush Basket Shelf Kitchen Organization R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KiBw5MBhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multi-purpose Kitchen Sink Rack： This kitchen sink rack expands the storage space, adds a hanging rod for hanging rags, and adds extra storage space for your kitchen sink. You can put brushes, soaps, sponges, detergents, hand wash, dish rags etc. together. The sink rack keeps your kitchen countertop clean and tidy. Keep Kitchen Counter Dry： There is a removable plastic drip tray under the kitchen sink caddy, which can collect dripping water under cleaning accessories such as caddy, dish towel, dish brush, rag, sponge, soap, etc., to protect your countertop from water stains. The horizontal drainage design of the kitchen sink organizer can speed up the drainage, making the air more circulate, let your sponge and scrubber dry quickly and prevent odor. Rust-proof and Durable : The sink organizers for soap and sponges is made of high-quality 304 stainless steel, which is rust-proof, moisture-proof, strong and durable. Prevent the cleaning supplies from falling by raising the fence of the shelf. The modern design ensures that the sponge holder is aesthetics and durable, and can be used in the kitchen for a long time. Independent space & detachable : This sink caddy has a separate brush holder that can store all brushes of different lengths. There is a place to holder sponge brushes and scrubbing pads in the front of the brush basket, and a hanging rod for hanging rags on the side. The basket and hanging rod are detachable, and the installation of the kitchen sink sponge holder is very simple, without the use of any tools, it can be completed in a few seconds. Practical sink caddy : The simple and practical kitchen sink caddy is an indispensable daily storage tool, which can quickly dry and store cleaning supplies. It can be used not only for kitchen sinks, but also for storing items on washstands. (You will get 1 x sink storage rack, 1 x drip tray, 1x brush storage basket, 1x rag hanger)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KiBw5MBhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Newruiheng","source_asin":"B09MTCFSC6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-813740","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MTCFSC6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MTCFSC6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
