window.products.push({"id":813942,"name":"Palace Imports 100% Solid Wood Dresser, Honey Pine. Requires Assembly","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91nHQVW4VCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"While taking only small area of your valuable floor space, this double dresser offers a lot of storage capacity thanks to four huge super jumbo drawers at the bottom and two large jumbo drawers at the top. Well engineered and aesthetically pleasing, this double dresser will be compatible with many design ideas and interiors. Framed top prevents micro-cracking and has the appealing grooves. Metal Euro glides with safety stops offer smooth operation while plywood bottoms guarantee that even heavy items will be secured inside the drawers. The dresser’s functionality is enhanced by the aesthetics of the all wood construction. 100% pine wood is beautiful, but to balance its knotty nature, wood veneer is used on large panels over solid wood boards. This gives it a silky smooth feel and a spot-free appeal. Available in three hand painted finishes it can match your interior or you can choose other perfectly compatible furniture pieces from Palace Imports.Overall Size: 48”w x 33”h x 17”d Colors: Mahogany, Honey Pine, Java Color/Wood Samples: Actual color may vary. Wood samples are mailed out for color matching upon request Paint: Lead-free compliant with the U.S. Federal Hazardous Substances Act Construction:- Solid wood vertical panel in the center for stability- Two solid wood cross ties at the bottom for added rigidity- 4 mm (5/32”) plywood back panels nailed to frame creating robust structure- Side panel Euro glides mounted at the factory - Framed top to prevent micro cracking. Grooves enhance aestheticsDrawer Details:- 4 deep large capacity super jumbo size drawers- Interior dimensions: 20\"w x 13.5\"d x 8.25\"h- 2 standard size drawers- Interior dimensions: 20\"w x 13.5\"d x 5.25\"h- Metal Euro roller glides with safety stops for smooth running, heavy loads and long lifespan- Face panels with beveled edges - 4 mm (5/32”) plywood bottoms hold substantial weight- Pocket hole butt joints. Easy assembly with screwsOptions: Mirror sold separately Knobs: - Wood with tenon for tight hold - Metal antique brass sold separately  Material: 100% Pine wood. Large panels have wood veneer over solid wood  Wood Quality: Pine is kiln dried to prevent splitting and size distortion  Compatibility: Other matching pieces available in identical color and style from Palace Imports Assembly: Requires assembly. Only screwdriver/screw gun and hammer needed.Shipping:- Ships flat in one box- Factory boxes packaged into additional double-wall carton boxes in USA for best protectionEcology: “Smart Wood” sustainable tree farms are the only source of all wood as required by Brazilian lawCountry of Origin: Brazil","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91nHQVW4VCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Palace Imports","source_asin":"B07CQPDQ4K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-813942","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CQPDQ4K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CQPDQ4K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
