window.products.push({"id":813974,"name":"WnkimTech Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 25Kpa Powerful Suction Stick Vacuum for Hardwood Floor, Up to 45 Mins Rechargeable Battery, 6 in 1 Lightweight Upri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ffCeWl7CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WnkimTech S700 cordless vacuum comes with 265W motor and 25000pa strong suction which works great on the hardwood floor and low pile carpet but is not perfect for med-long pile carpet and surface with water. Let's See How can WnkimTech S700 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner be A Cost-effective Cordless Stick Vacuums! ——265W Motor+3 speed suction power The cordless vacuum provides continuous 25KPa extremely powerful suction in DEEP mode so that instantly picks up pet hair, fine dust, debris, large particles from carpet, hardwood floor, tile floor, marble floor, etc. 10kpa - Eco mode can offer up to 45 minutes continuous cleaning，25kpa - Deep mode can offer up to 15 minutes deep cleaning，15Kpa - Normal model can offer up to 25 minutes deep cleaning ——4 stages filtration system + Extendable Tube + Motorized Brush with LED Light High-density filtration technology provides pure air for your family and prevents secondary air pollution for an excellent cleaning experience This excellent cordless vacuum can meet various household cleaning demands on stairs and windowsills, sofa and bed, desk and curtain, cars, RV, etc. Vacuum cleaner cordless with motorized cleaner head with bright LED lights, you can swivel the wand sideways and up and down to easily clean the dust in every corner or under the sofa ——Convenient Charging + Easy Storage + 1 L Large Dust Cup Charge the compact vacuum cleaner cordless directly or charge the battery part separately both ok The hard surface vacuum has a wall mount to place or detached storage. Cordless vacuums for carpet and floors keep your home tidy and organized Lightweight vacuum cleaner cordless with a one-touch, easy-empty 1L large dust cup, larger than similar products ——Self-Standing With self-standing design, you can stand this Upright vacuum cleaner easily wherever you want, no need to drill the bracket into the wall for hanging, also needn't lean against a wall. ——No Tangle & Without Switching Brush Stiff/Soft bristles are integrated on a tangle-free roller that rolls up messes from all kinds of floors conveniently without switching the brush and is perfect for protecting various surfaces. ——Multifunctional & Lightweight Vacuum Its lightweight and portable main motor is only 3 pounds about 1 bottle of 1000ml water so you can take it anywhere or go & downstairs, extremely suitable for one-hand cleaning. With versatile attachments, household vacuum cleaners can easily detach from a handheld vacuum. It can be applied to different scenarios such as furniture, ceiling, stair, or car, which solves the troubles of traditional vacuum cleaners that are inconvenient to clean hard-to-reach corners. ——All-IN-One LED Visual Touch Display The cordless stick vacuum's large LED display let you monitor the status of vacuum cleaner cordless better in real time, including battery levels, suction performance, suction blockage alert. You can touch control 3 suction speeds, never worries about hitting a button by mistake like traditional vacuum cleaner. Package List: Main Motor with Dustbin LED Motorized Cleaner Brush Retractable Metal Tube Wall Bracket with Screws Dust Brush Long Crevice Tool Cleaning Gadget 2x HEPA-Filter(One in Dustbin) User Manual Warm tips for using our cordless vacuum cleaner: 1. Please use the original adapter to fully charge before you use it for the first time because of long-distance transportation. 2. Please empty the trash in the dust cup after cleaning, and make sure the amount of garbage is not over 80% of the dust cup.Over garbage will block the vents and cause the suction to decay rapidly. 3. Please note to check whether the tube is blocked and the floor brush is tangled with hairs before use. These may cause the power of suction to be weakened or stop working. 4. Please clean your dust cup, filter and stainless steel strainer regularly to prevent suction loss and blockage, maintain good suction, ensure the filters are completely dry before refitting. We kindly recommend exchanging the HEPA filter every 3 months according to your use frequency. 5. The vacuum is equipped with 3 suction modes. The using time can be up to 45 mins. Working time of each one: 15 minutes on the deep mode, and 45 minutes on the eco model, normal-mode:25 mins. The using time is different in various situations. When you use it to clean some large-size debris or particles, it might decrease the using time because of the heavy cleaning task.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ffCeWl7CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WnkimTech","source_asin":"B0BKZ8DLWM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-813974","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKZ8DLWM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKZ8DLWM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
